  "definition": "Peak device memory during one M=(k+1)N verify forward, above the resident state that survives the forward: transient = mx.get_peak_memory() - active_memory_after (weights and K/V + recurrent cache, including its growth during the forward, excluded). Reported per lane as total/N.",
